From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:15:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applications: Access to the camera, a security key and the
 network per app

The group Access on an app's page: Ask, Allow or Don't Allow for the camera
(the camera portal's answer for the phone's own cameras, plinius-appaccess
for cameras on USB), a security key and the network, with how often the app
used them or was blocked (plinius-appaccess, org.plinius.AppAccess1), for
the network also its connections of the last 24 hours (plinius-netlog). It is
the page's group of Required Permissions, the three rows on top of Required
Permissions and Global Shortcuts, so that what the app may use is one group.
The code is a file of its own, cc-plinius-appaccess.c, called after the
usage section has set that group's rows; GNOME's camera switch of Flatpak
apps is hidden while the group shows, without the daemon the group is as
GNOME has it.
---
 panels/applications/cc-applications-panel.c | 5 +++++
 panels/applications/meson.build             | 1 +
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/panels/applications/cc-applications-panel.c b/panels/applications/cc-applications-panel.c
index f4c14e8cf..e55793c2d 100644
--- a/panels/applications/cc-applications-panel.c
+++ b/panels/applications/cc-applications-panel.c
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@
 #include "cc-list-row-info-button.h"
 #include "cc-list-row.h"
 #include "cc-plinius-software.h"
+#include "cc-plinius-appaccess.h"
 #include "cc-removable-media-settings.h"
 #include "shell/cc-window.h"
 #ifdef HAVE_SNAP
@@ -1460,6 +1461,10 @@ update_panel (CcApplicationsPanel *self, GtkListBoxRow *row)
     update_permissions_group (self, info);
     update_handler_dialog (self, info);
     update_usage_section (self, info);
+    /* Plinius: camera, microphone, security key and network per app (plinius-appaccess), on top
+     * of the group of Required Permissions */
+    cc_plinius_appaccess_update_app_page (CC_PANEL (self), info, GTK_WIDGET (self->required_permissions_group),
+                                          GTK_WIDGET (self->camera_row), GTK_WIDGET (self->microphone_row));
 
     g_set_object (&self->current_app_info, info);
     self->current_app_id = get_app_id (info);
diff --git a/panels/applications/meson.build b/panels/applications/meson.build
index 2018c992f..72e7aca0e 100644
--- a/panels/applications/meson.build
+++ b/panels/applications/meson.build
@@ -44,6 +44,7 @@ sources = files(
   'cc-default-apps-row.c',
   'cc-plinius-software.c',
   'cc-plinius-webapps.c',
+  'cc-plinius-appaccess.c',
   'cc-removable-media-settings.c',
   'globs.c',
   'search.c',
